# Ballad: a slow pop ballad at ~72. Drums from the Groove MIDI Dataset (drummer 7, a rock ballad at 75,
# CC BY 4.0: styles/README.md): Main A on the cross-stick, Main B on the snare; the rest written for Polly
# over C M7.
# Main A: piano arpeggios in eighths, a fretless bass on roots and fifths, soft strings.
# Main B: the piano in quarter-note chords with a lift, the strings up, a high string line, the bass moving.
# Intro: the piano alone, the broken chord from the top down, then the bass, a soft kick and hi-hat and a
# rolled chord. Fill AB climbs the chord; Fill BA comes down the toms, the piano falling from the top.
style Ballad
tempo 72

track d1 type=bypass chan=10 vol=118 rev=48
track d2 type=bypass chan=10 vol=118 rev=48   # shares channel 10 with d1: the same mixer
track pc type=bypass chan=10 vol=118 rev=48
track ba type=bass program=35 chan=2 lo=E1 hi=G3 hikey=F# vol=116 rev=30
track c1 type=chord1 program=0 chan=3 lo=C3 hi=C6 hikey=off vol=124 pan=54 rev=64
track c2 type=chord1 program=48 chan=4 lo=G4 hi=G6 hikey=F# vol=86 pan=80 rev=80
track c3 type=chord2 program=49 chan=5 lo=F3 hi=C5 vol=88 pan=64 rev=80 cho=20

